Clean implementation cutovers

Install:
  Back up and copy the bundled skill files.

Upgrade:
  Replace only this bundled skill using the same installation steps.

Status:
  Status checks local SKILL.md files without a network request.

Requirements:
  A regular user and standard file utilities; no separate runtime is needed to copy the skill.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/clean-cutover
  An existing Codex copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/clean-cutover becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ~/.local/state/wsley/skills-backups/.
